  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T J.299 describes the functional requirements for an auto configuration server (ACS) and a set-top box (STB) connected to each other for the purpose of remote maintenance. ACS is usually used to remotely set up and maintain customer premises equipment (CPE) such as an STB. The major purpose of the Recommendation is to specify basic requirements for remote maintenance in the cable television system.</abstract>
